Title: Caseless Cue Negatives
Credit: Written by
Author: Test Fixture

INT. TEA HOUSE - DAY

A kettle ticks as it cools. Nobody has spoken for a while.

たなか
I already told you what I saw.

The screen door rattles in its frame.

מרים
You told me what you wanted to have seen.

Steam gives up and stops rising.

مريم
Then we are agreed on nothing.

EXT. STREET - LATER

Three bicycles chained to the same post. Rain has started again
and none of them is going anywhere.

FADE OUT.
